        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Domain rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Seat represents a physical seat reused across showtimes.&lt;br&gt;Each Ticket identifies one Showtime and one Seat.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Constraint:&lt;/b&gt; At most one sold Ticket per (Showtime, Seat) pair.&lt;br&gt;Ticket and Payment describe successful purchases in this simplified model." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fillColor=#FFF7DF;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
